 "id": "01a0f83d-ac80-7fa3-bce6-00ae34c16484",
 "evidence": "There's no docker-compose/compose file in the repo, and no test uses Postgres or the `postgres` marker. The only tests are tests/test_tax.py (a pure unit test) and tests/test_payments.py, marked `integration`, which POSTs to https://sandbox.payments.example/v1/charges over the network. So `make test` needs the dev deps installed and network access to that sandbox, not a database. Also, `make test-fast` filters on `-m \"not postgres\"`, so it does NOT skip the integration test.",
 "source_file": "Makefile"
}
